\title{Pretraining}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{language-model}
\tag{pretraining}

\p{Pretraining chooses data, an objective, and an update procedure before
task-specific feedback is introduced. This section separates the population
quantity being optimized from its finite-data estimate and the stochastic
updates used to reduce that estimate.}

